01:05.241 --> 01:07.827
--There it is
.Grandma's house
——就在这儿
.奶奶家

01:07.896 --> 01:10.206
What wonders
?await me today
有什么奇怪的
？今天等我

01:10.275 --> 01:11.689
?Fresh-baked cookies
?新鲜出炉的饼干

01:11.758 --> 01:13.241
?Story time
?故事时间

01:13.310 --> 01:15.758
A sweater with love
?in every stitch
一件充满爱的毛衣
？每一针

01:15.827 --> 01:17.689
?Aw, what am I waiting for
？噢，我还在等什么

01:17.758 --> 01:19.620
!Grandma, Grandma, Grandma
！奶奶，奶奶，奶奶

01:19.689 --> 01:22.275
!SpongeBob
!海绵宝宝

01:22.344 --> 01:23.551
!Hi, Grandma
！嗨，奶奶

01:23.620 --> 01:26.724
.Come in and sit for a while
.进来坐一会儿

01:26.793 --> 01:29.448
,Have a cookie
.SpongeBob
,吃一块饼干
.海绵宝宝

01:29.517 --> 01:33.310
Grandma, you make
the best cookies
.in the deep blue sea
奶奶，你做的
最好的饼干
.在深蓝色的大海里

01:34.551 --> 01:36.965
...Oh, yeah
...哦，是的

01:37.034 --> 01:39.551
[munches ]
[咀嚼]

01:39.620 --> 01:40.551
[gulps ]
[咽口水]

01:40.620 --> 01:44.241
...Grandma's cookies
...奶奶的饼干

01:44.310 --> 01:46.793
Now, who wants to
?lick the spoon
现在，谁愿意
?舔勺子

01:46.862 --> 01:49.344
!Oh! Me, me, me
！哦！我，我，我

01:49.413 --> 01:52.448
And then we drove...
all the way home
然后我们就开车...
一路回家

01:52.517 --> 01:56.448
with all the windows down
.in the freezing cold
所有窗户都放下
.在严寒中

01:56.517 --> 01:59.655
Tell me another story
.about when I was a baby
告诉我另一个故事
.关于我还是个婴儿的时候

01:59.724 --> 02:02.344
[cuckoo clock chimes 3:00 ]
[布谷鸟钟鸣响3:00]

02:02.413 --> 02:03.689
!?gasps] 3:00 ]
！？喘息] 3:00 ]

02:03.758 --> 02:05.413
I'm going to be late
!for work
我要迟到了
！为了工作

02:05.482 --> 02:07.206
.Hop in my car
.I'll drop you off
.跳上我的车
.我送你下车

02:09.103 --> 02:10.517
!Thanks, Grandma
！谢谢奶奶

02:10.586 --> 02:13.482
...SpongeBob
!you forgot your kissy-kissy
...海绵宝宝
！你忘记了你的亲吻

02:13.551 --> 02:15.448
.I sure did
.我确实做到了

02:16.482 --> 02:18.344
[kisses ]
[亲吻]

02:18.413 --> 02:20.103
!Bye, Grandma
!Thanks for the ride
！再见，奶奶
！感谢您的搭车

02:20.172 --> 02:21.448
.Thank you, Squidward
.谢谢你，章鱼哥

02:21.517 --> 02:22.965
[others chuckling ]
[其他人窃笑]

02:23.034 --> 02:24.137
...Oh, brother
……哦，兄弟

02:24.206 --> 02:26.862
[whistling ]
[吹口哨]

02:26.931 --> 02:28.551
?Isn't this great
？这不是很棒吗

02:28.620 --> 02:30.482
Everybody's
.in a good mood today
每个人的
.今天心情好

02:30.551 --> 02:33.862
I love bursting
.your bubble, SpongeBob
我爱爆了
.你的泡泡，海绵宝宝

02:33.931 --> 02:37.586
,They're laughing atyou
.not with you
,他们在嘲笑你
.不和你在一起

02:37.655 --> 02:39.068
Did I do
?something funny
我做了吗
？有趣的事情

02:39.137 --> 02:41.172
.Your forehead
.你的额头

02:41.241 --> 02:42.689
?My forehead is funny
？我的额头很有趣

02:42.758 --> 02:44.793
!Hey, grandma's boy
！嘿，奶奶的儿子

02:44.862 --> 02:46.827
!Kissy-kissy-kissy
！亲吻亲吻

02:46.896 --> 02:48.965
[...all laughing ]
[……全都笑了]

02:49.034 --> 02:52.206
!No! You're wrong
！不！你错了

02:52.275 --> 02:53.827
...There
there's nothing wrong
...那里
没什么问题

02:53.896 --> 02:55.931
with getting kisses
!from your grandma
与接吻
！来自你奶奶

02:56.000 --> 03:01.482
No... especially if you're
!a big baby who wears diapers
不...尤其是如果你
！一个穿尿布的大婴儿

03:01.551 --> 03:03.310
[all laugh ]
[全场大笑]

03:03.379 --> 03:05.793
And, and sucks his thumb
并且，并且吮吸他的拇指

03:05.862 --> 03:07.689
and plays with dolls
和玩娃娃

03:07.758 --> 03:11.103
and, um, wears pajamas
with feet in them
而且，呃，穿着睡衣
有脚在里面

03:11.172 --> 03:15.310
,and carries his, um, uh
...binky around, and, uh
，并带着他的，嗯，呃
...宾基周围，并且，呃

03:15.379 --> 03:17.413
:OTHERS
!All right already
:其他
！已经好了

03:17.482 --> 03:19.000
.Cheer up, SpongeBob
.海绵宝宝，加油

03:19.068 --> 03:21.551
I know someone
.who still likes you
我认识一个人
.谁还喜欢你

03:21.620 --> 03:24.448
?Really
?You do, Squidward
？真的吗
？你知道，章鱼哥

03:24.517 --> 03:26.448
!Yeah... your grandma
！是啊...你的奶奶

03:26.517 --> 03:28.448
[...all laughing ]
[……全都笑了]

03:28.517 --> 03:30.344
[...laughter continues ]
[……笑声继续]

03:33.344 --> 03:34.862
[...all laughing ]
[……全都笑了]

03:36.896 --> 03:40.103
[grunting ]
[咕噜声]

03:40.172 --> 03:43.482
[all laughing ]
[全都笑了]

03:43.551 --> 03:46.379
!...Stop it
！...停下来

03:46.448 --> 03:50.448
I have been publicly humiliated
!for the last time
我曾被公开羞辱
！最后一次

03:50.517 --> 03:53.034
[crying ]
[哭泣]

03:53.103 --> 03:56.310
:PATRICK
I'm sorry that happened
.to you, SpongeBob
：帕特里克
我很抱歉发生了这样的事
.给你，海绵宝宝

03:56.379 --> 03:57.793
.Me, too
。我也是

03:57.862 --> 03:59.827
You're the most adult person
.I know
你是最成熟的人
.我知道

03:59.896 --> 04:01.000
.Thanks, Patrick
.谢谢，帕特里克

04:01.068 --> 04:02.758
.You know how grandmas are
.你知道奶奶是怎样的

04:02.827 --> 04:04.275
.They love babies
.他们喜欢婴儿

04:04.344 --> 04:07.068
You just can't act
.like a baby around her
你只是无法行动
.就像她身边的婴儿一样

04:07.137 --> 04:08.379
.You're right, Patrick
.你是对的，帕特里克

04:08.448 --> 04:10.517
?Have I ever not been right
？我有没有说错过

04:10.586 --> 04:11.793
[sizzling ]
[热气腾腾]

04:11.862 --> 04:13.068
[honking ]
[鸣喇叭]

04:13.137 --> 04:14.448
[wolf-whistle ]
[狼哨]

04:14.517 --> 04:16.206
,You're a man now
SpongeBob
,你现在是个男人了
海绵宝宝

04:16.275 --> 04:18.862
and it's time you
.started acting like one
现在是你的时候了
.开始表现得像一个人

04:18.931 --> 04:20.448
!Yeah
！是的

04:20.517 --> 04:24.689
Oh... but I'm not sure
.I know how
哦...但我不确定
.我知道怎么做

04:24.758 --> 04:27.275
Allow me
.to demonstrate
请允许我
.证明

04:27.344 --> 04:30.344
,First
.puff out your chest
,首先
.挺起胸膛

04:30.413 --> 04:32.103
".Now say "tax exemption
”.现在说“免税

04:32.172 --> 04:33.620
!Tax exemption
!免税

04:33.689 --> 04:37.413
Now you must acquire
.a taste for free-form jazz
现在你必须获得
.对自由爵士乐的品味

04:37.482 --> 04:41.310
[trumpet plays fast jazz riff ]
[小号演奏快速爵士即兴重复段]

04:41.379 --> 04:43.448
,Okay, SpongeBob
!you're ready
，好吧，海绵宝宝
！你准备好了

04:45.068 --> 04:46.310
.This is it
.就是这样

04:46.379 --> 04:48.137
What are you going
?to tell Grandma
你要去做什么
?告诉奶奶

04:48.206 --> 04:49.241
.I'm a grownup
.我是个大人了

04:49.310 --> 04:51.206
.No ifs, ands or buts about it
.没有如果、和或但是

04:51.275 --> 04:53.517
A man's got to do
.what a man's got to do
一个男人必须做的事
.男人必须做什么

04:53.586 --> 04:55.482
And then you get behind her
.and I'll push
然后你就到她身后
.我会推动

04:55.551 --> 04:57.241
.Patrick, we didn't say that
.帕特里克，我们没这么说

04:57.310 --> 04:58.379
.Oh, yeah, right
.哦，是的，对了

04:58.448 --> 04:59.689
All we need now
我们现在需要的一切

04:59.758 --> 05:01.793
is the icing
.on the maturity cake
是锦上添花
.在成熟蛋糕上

05:01.862 --> 05:04.379
I've been growing
.these babies for years
我一直在成长
.这些婴儿多年来

05:06.517 --> 05:09.137
:BOTH
...Sideburns
：两者
...鬓角

05:11.344 --> 05:13.620
.Oh, hello, SpongeBob
.哦，你好，海绵宝宝

05:13.689 --> 05:16.172
.What a nice surprise
.多么好的惊喜啊

05:16.241 --> 05:19.655
Come here, give your granny
.her kissy-kissy
过来，给你奶奶
.她的亲吻

05:20.586 --> 05:24.000
...Mmm
...嗯

05:24.068 --> 05:25.413
[kisses ]
[亲吻]

05:27.793 --> 05:30.172
,Sorry, Grandmother
.but the kissing has to stop
,对不起,奶奶
.但是接吻必须停止

05:30.241 --> 05:32.344
.Tell her like it is, SpongeBob
.就这样告诉她吧，海绵宝宝

05:32.413 --> 05:34.793
.No more baby stuff
.不再有婴儿用品

05:34.862 --> 05:36.413
.He is right, Grandmother
.他是对的，祖母

05:36.482 --> 05:38.551
,Kisses are for babies
.which I am no longer
,亲吻是给婴儿的
.我不再是

05:38.620 --> 05:39.620
.I have grown up
.我已经长大了

05:39.689 --> 05:40.896
.It is nature's way
.这是自然之道

05:40.965 --> 05:45.793
.Oh... you are absolutely right
.哦...你说得完全正确

05:45.862 --> 05:46.862
?I am
？我是

05:46.931 --> 05:48.758
.I mean, of course I am
.我的意思是，我当然是

05:48.827 --> 05:52.655
You will definitely
not be treated like a baby
你一定会
不被当作婴儿对待

05:52.724 --> 05:54.896
.around here ever again
.再次来到这里

05:54.965 --> 05:57.482
I am glad you see it
.my way, Grandmother
我很高兴你看到它
.我的方式，祖母

05:57.551 --> 05:59.655
:GRANDMA
Well, I'm glad
.that's settled
:奶奶
嗯，我很高兴
.就这样解决了

05:59.724 --> 06:01.241
But what am I
going to do
但我是什么
要做

06:01.310 --> 06:03.379
with all these
?fresh-baked cookies
与所有这些
?新鲜出炉的饼干

06:03.448 --> 06:05.068
[chuckles ]
.Sorry, Grandmother
[笑声]
.对不起，祖母

06:05.137 --> 06:07.793
We adults don't partake
.in the consumption of sweets
我们大人不参加
.在甜食的消费中

06:07.862 --> 06:08.793
...Right, Pat
...对了，帕特

06:08.862 --> 06:10.310
?rick
？里克

06:10.379 --> 06:12.000
,Keep 'em coming
!Granny
，让他们继续来
！奶奶

06:12.068 --> 06:13.172
[slurping ]
[吸吮]

06:13.241 --> 06:16.137
.So much for no more baby stuff
.关于婴儿用品就这么多了

06:16.206 --> 06:20.344
And don't forget the
!cookie-eating hat
并且不要忘记
!吃饼干的帽子

06:20.413 --> 06:21.517
[laughs ]
[笑]

06:21.586 --> 06:22.655
[both laughing ]
[两人都笑了]

06:22.724 --> 06:23.724
!Hey
！嘿

06:23.793 --> 06:26.068
!That's my cookie-eating hat
！那是我的吃饼干帽子

06:26.137 --> 06:28.827
Uh... I mean, it was
!when I was a baby
呃...我是说，那是
！当我还是个婴儿的时候

06:28.896 --> 06:29.758
...Grr
...咕噜

06:30.862 --> 06:33.689
.Well, look who's here
.好吧，看看谁在这里

06:33.758 --> 06:36.275
It's my big old
.adult grandson
这是我的大老
.成年孙子

06:36.344 --> 06:39.655
Grandmother, I need to have
a mature conversation
奶奶，我需要
成熟的谈话

06:39.724 --> 06:41.068
.with Mr. Patrick
.与帕特里克先生

06:41.137 --> 06:43.793
!Patrick
!?What are you doing
！帕特里克
！？你在做什么

06:43.862 --> 06:45.793
!Cookies! Warm milk
！曲奇饼！温牛奶

06:45.862 --> 06:47.275
!A bib
！围兜

06:47.344 --> 06:49.310
Is that a kissy mark
?on your forehead
那是吻痕吗
？在你的额头上

06:49.379 --> 06:50.931
!We are supposed to be adults
！我们应该是成年人了

06:51.000 --> 06:52.241
.Uh-uh-uh
.呃-呃-呃

06:52.310 --> 06:54.862
No roughhousing
.with a full tummy
不打闹
.肚子饱满

06:54.931 --> 06:56.034
[laughing ]
[笑]

06:56.103 --> 06:57.482
?Who's the baby
?谁是宝贝

06:57.551 --> 07:00.172
,I'm the baby, I'm the baby
!I'm the baby
，我是宝贝，我是宝贝
！我是宝宝

07:00.241 --> 07:02.241
[clears throat ]
[清嗓子]

07:02.310 --> 07:04.482
!Being grownup is boring
！长大了很无聊

07:04.551 --> 07:06.413
.I love being a baby
.我喜欢当婴儿

07:06.482 --> 07:08.896
.Besides, I don't get jazz
.此外，我不懂爵士乐

07:08.965 --> 07:10.310
.Oh, poor Patrick
.哦，可怜的帕特里克

07:10.379 --> 07:12.586
.I almost feel sorry for you
.我几乎为你感到难过

07:14.413 --> 07:17.344
Trapped in the awkward phase
.of diaper days
陷入尴尬阶段
.尿布日

07:17.413 --> 07:20.517
Never to know
the rich rewards
.of being a grownup
永远不知道
丰富的奖励
.成为一个成年人

07:20.586 --> 07:22.931
.Here's a fresh batch of cookies
.这是一批新鲜的饼干

07:23.000 --> 07:24.275
!All right
！好的

07:24.344 --> 07:26.448
[munching ]
[咀嚼]

07:26.517 --> 07:28.413
?Rewards, huh
？奖励啊

07:28.482 --> 07:29.758
...Well, yeah, there's
...嗯，是的，有

07:29.827 --> 07:31.379
[munching ]
[咀嚼]

07:31.448 --> 07:33.551
...Let's see, we, uh
...让我们看看，我们，呃

07:33.620 --> 07:34.689
.we went over the jazz
.我们回顾了爵士乐

07:36.137 --> 07:38.344
[munching ]
[咀嚼]

07:40.137 --> 07:42.620
,Oh, Grandma
.I'm full
，哦，奶奶
.我吃饱了

07:42.689 --> 07:44.103
.More cookies
.更多饼干

07:45.620 --> 07:49.586
[...vacuum cleaner running ]
[...吸尘器正在运行]

07:53.172 --> 07:54.931
[whistling ]
[吹口哨]

07:55.000 --> 07:56.724
.It appears to be my lunch hour
.现在似乎是我的午餐时间

07:56.793 --> 07:58.275
.Grownups have to eat, too
.大人也要吃饭

07:58.344 --> 08:00.241
.I guess this will have to do
.我想这必须做

08:00.310 --> 08:02.620
:GRANDMA
Oh, you don't want
.this baby food
:奶奶
哦，你不想
.这个婴儿食品

08:02.689 --> 08:06.137
How about a big piece
?of steamed coral
来一大块怎么样
？蒸珊瑚

08:06.206 --> 08:08.655
.Oh, yeah, uh... great
.哦，是的，呃...太棒了

08:08.724 --> 08:10.586
[crunching ]
[咀嚼]

08:10.655 --> 08:11.896
!Nutritious
！营养丰富

08:11.965 --> 08:13.827
:GRANDMA
!Story time
:奶奶
！故事时间

08:13.896 --> 08:17.310
,Oh, boy! Story time
!story time, story time
，哦，孩子！故事时间
！故事时间，故事时间

08:17.379 --> 08:19.275
?Story time
?故事时间

08:19.344 --> 08:20.965
,You'll enjoy this
.Patrick
,你会喜欢这个
.帕特里克

08:21.034 --> 08:24.689
It's a wonderful story
.about a magical sea leprechaun
这是一个美妙的故事
.关于神奇的海妖精

08:24.758 --> 08:28.896
Oh, SpongeBob, you wouldn't be
.interested in this babybook
噢，海绵宝宝，你不会的
.对这本婴儿书感兴趣

08:28.965 --> 08:32.931
Here's the technical manual
.on Routine Active Maintenance
这是技术手册
.关于日常主动维护

